+ * @slot: VCQ command slot to populate
+ * @core_id: PKE hardware core ID
+ * @curve: Curve identifier (e.g. NIST P-256, P-384, P-521)
+ * @dlen: Digest length in bytes
+ * @pk_dma: DMA address of public key buffer
